        comment Comment1 START ENEL 585 Project D - totem-pole PFC, HIL plant (no control). Transformer secondary line-to-line, 35-36.7 V rms.<br>Startup: Load A/B off, Bbp open -> close B2 (diodes charge C_dc through 2 x R_pc) -> close Bbp -> loads -> PWM.<br>Edit R_load_A / R_load_B (and the assumed R_tx, L_tx) in Model Settings > Model initialization, then recompile. ENDCOMMENT 
        [
            position = 6336, 7648
        ]

        comment Comment2 START Q1/Q2 (leg a, fast, on L_boost): DI1 top, DI2 bottom<br>Q3/Q4 (leg b, on the return): DI3 top, DI4 bottom ENDCOMMENT 
        [
            position = 7688, 7744
        ]

        comment Comment3 START AO1: ADC_VProbe2 (V_dc) -> J3.23 ADCINA6<br>AO2: ADC_VProbe1 (v_g) -> J3.24 ADCINB2<br>AO9: ADC_CProbe2 (i_load) -> J7.63 ADCINB0<br>AO10: ADC_CProbe1 (i_L) -> J7.64 ADCINA10 ENDCOMMENT 
        [
            position = 7888, 8560
        ]

